  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Plots the brush (brush_ptr) in current_colour around the selected pixel (pixel_x, pixel_y). The brush is a list of (dx, dy) byte pairs; $80 ends it. A point outside 0-max_x or 0-max_y is not plotted. In mirror mode each point is plotted 4 times ($1808), else one time ($1841). At the end selects the centre pixel again ($18f7) and gets its pixel value (get_colour_slot). It is a plot_vector routine of the line routines."},
    {"at":23,"placement":"side","text":"X > max_x: the point is not plotted."},
    {"at":40,"placement":"side","text":"Y > max_y: the point is not plotted."},
    {"at":71,"placement":"side","text":"Skips dy of a point that is not plotted."}
  ],
